      "matters": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar Aug-02-2005 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This cause came on regularly as scheduled for OSC hearing for Change of Name.<br>Commissioner: Sue Kaplan, Clerk: S. Ravinantapricha, CSR: Gena Eales.<br>Petitioner: Kwok Yee Chu, present in pro per, and with Cantonese Interpreter: Li Hong Tan.<br>Petitioner and Interpreter were sworn and examined.<br>No objections to the proposed change of name were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct, and sufficient and that the petition should be granted.<br>The Court grants the petition for Change of Name to: Guo Yi Zhu.<br>Decree signed in open court.<br>",
